{"id":"1w4usao","title":"FST — Fully autonomous trading.","author":"deskcoffee_daily8","created_utc":1788308567,"score":1,"selftext":" *FST* *—* *Fully* *autonomous* *trading.* *Get* *your* *screen-time* *back.*\n\n  *Ever* *been* *there:* *you* *have* *an* *approach* *you* *trust,* *but* *no* *time* *to* *sit* *and* *watch* *the* *charts* *all* *day.* *And* *when*\n\n  *the* *market* *moves,* *manual* *execution* *always* *feels* *a* *beat* *too* *slow.*\n\n  *FST* *(Full* *Self* *Trading)* *is* *a* *fully* *autonomous* *trading* *agent.* *You* *set* *it* *up,* *it* *runs* *in* *the* *cloud,* *and*\n\n  *handles* *execution* *on* *its* *own* *—* *no* *need* *to* *babysit* *the* *screen.*\n\n  *What* *it* *does* *for* *you*\n\n  *-* *Fully* *autonomous* *execution:* *from* *entry* *to* *exit,* *handled* *automatically* *—* *no* *manual* *order* *placing*\n\n  *-* *Runs* *continuously:* *once* *deployed,* *it* *keeps* *watching* *the* *market* *and* *acts* *when* *it* *should*\n\n  *-* *You're* *not* *chained* *to* *the* *charts:* *go* *do* *your* *other* *work;* *it* *does* *the* *watching*\n\n  *What* *it* *is* *not*\n\n  *-* *Not* *a* *\"get-rich\"* *machine* *—* *no* *guaranteed* *returns*\n\n  *-* *Doesn't* *remove* *risk* *—* *risk* *is* *always* *there*\n\n  *Risk* *disclaimer:* *All* *trading* *involves* *risk,* *automated* *trading* *included.* *Only* *use* *capital* *you* *can* *afford* *to* *lose.*","url":"https://www.reddit.com/r/ai_trading/comments/1w4usao/fst_fully_autonomous_trading/","comments":[{"id":"p7ab48v","author":"Master-Psychology477","body":"Gracias ","score":1,"created_utc":1788309209,"is_op":false,"replies":[]}]}